{"words": [{"text": "وَيَسْـَٔلُونَكَ", "translation": "And they ask you"}, {"text": "عَنِ", "translation": "about"}, {"text": "ٱلْمَحِيضِ ۖ", "translation": "[the] menstruation"}, {"text": "قُلْ", "translation": "Say"}, {"text": "هُوَ", "translation": "It"}, {"text": "أَذًۭى", "translation": "(is) a hurt"}, {"text": "فَٱعْتَزِلُوا۟", "translation": "so keep away (from)"}, {"text": "ٱلنِّسَآءَ", "translation": "[the] women"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "during"}, {"text": "ٱلْمَحِيضِ ۖ", "translation": "(their) [the] menstruation"}, {"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "And (do) not"}, {"text": "تَقْرَبُوهُنَّ", "translation": "approach them"}, {"text": "حَتَّىٰ", "translation": "until"}, {"text": "يَطْهُرْنَ ۖ", "translation": "they are cleansed"}, {"text": "فَإِذَا", "translation": "Then when"}, {"text": "تَطَهَّرْنَ", "translation": "they are purified"}, {"text": "فَأْتُوهُنَّ", "translation": "then come to them"}, {"text": "مِنْ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "حَيْثُ", "translation": "where"}, {"text": "أَمَرَكُمُ", "translation": "has ordered you"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ ۚ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "إِنَّ", "translation": "Indeed"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "يُحِبُّ", "translation": "loves"}, {"text": "ٱلتَّوَّٰبِينَ", "translation": "those who turn in repentance"}, {"text": "وَيُحِبُّ", "translation": "and loves"}, {"text": "ٱلْمُتَطَهِّرِينَ", "translation": "those who purify themselves"}], "sahih": "And they ask you about menstruation. Say, \"It is harm, so keep away from wives1 during menstruation. And do not approach them until they are pure. And when they have purified themselves,2 then come to them from where Allāh has ordained for you. Indeed, Allāh loves those who are constantly repentant and loves those who purify themselves.\""}